static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c866a7f4d5e00beae38c011aabbfb09e.mp4?t=1791385253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks around every corner. The dead have risen and are hungry, but rival players are the deadlier threat. The gunshots will close in from every direction. Every Hunter is competing for the same prize, which turns every match into a deadly showdown. When you finally make contact, ride the adrenaline rush. Every second matters, every bullet counts, and the smallest decisions will seal your fate. The biggest risks for the highest rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/6900b1de49ea472a57762a94e6a14c0b.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1545 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/df5125c70339df8f598327fa99255537.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c9c13c13b920d59b0bd5825ffb1f84cc.poster.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c9c13c13b920d59b0bd5825ffb1f84cc.webm?t=1791385253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c9c13c13b920d59b0bd5825ffb1f84cc.mp4?t=1791385253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is survival. Choose your team wisely as another pair of eyes can be the difference between life and death. Share your triumph in duos or trios. When you’re ready, take the challenge hunting solo. Relish your hard-earned victories, it’s taking the bounty that matters. Whether your match ended in a haul of loot or the cold embrace of death, know your fellow Hunters have walked that same line. As they say, Hunt Giveth or Hunt Taketh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/6900b1de49ea472a57762a94e6a14c0b.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1545 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/d30279c1242b6e8eac4a813aeed0ba4d.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/7d6f5a92647bbfd45b5f746b77faeecf.poster.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/7d6f5a92647bbfd45b5f746b77faeecf.webm?t=1791385253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/7d6f5a92647bbfd45b5f746b77faeecf.mp4?t=1791385253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express the way you play. Recruit from a diverse roster of Hunters, including Wild West gunslingers, twisted fanatics, and legendary warriors from further afield. Arm them with an array of distinctive weapons, from exquisite firearms to brutal, improvised hammers. With hundreds of unlocks and customizations beyond your Hunter and gear, no one will Hunt quite like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/6900b1de49ea472a57762a94e6a14c0b.avif?t=1791385253\" width=1545 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Hunt: Showdown 1896 is the brutally rewarding extraction shooter. Track twisted monsters and overcome ruthless PvP. Take bounties in corrupted backwaters lost to history. With a team, you might survive. Die with nothing or get out with everything.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Turkish, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Hunt: Showdown - The best Multiplayer-Shooter 2019 so far”<br>89% – Gamestar<br><br>“Crytek release their best game yet - and one of the most original multiplayer shooters ever”<br>Excellent – Eurogamer<br><br>“Hunt: Showdown offers one of the most strenuous multiplayer experiences I’ve ever had and I loved every second of it.”<br>8.5 Great – Dualshockers<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/8cf55bcd74fc14c93f3a9cc7d0a442afabab6f88/header_alt_assets_29.jpg?t=1791385253", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/5ce44c6d9874c1bfce5757ac53a27bfd486fcfec/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_29.jpg?t=1791385253", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/5ce44c6d9874c1bfce5757ac53a27bfd486fcfec/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_29.jpg?t=1791385253", "website": "https://www.huntshowdown.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU 7th Gen 7700 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB R